# Purpose
Explain the shared Terminal space and Quick Access shell, how to request visible
work, automatic session resume, passive output following and human controls.
# Source Review
Rewritten from the current native Terminal UI and bounded tool contract.
Source risk: internal implementation. Reuse only verified reader-visible actions.
Excluded: private paths, routing, credentials, account identifiers and service details.
# Gotchas
Tool availability varies by node and session. Guest utility access does not imply
agent access to a shared shell. Stop interrupts work; New session replaces it.
# Review
Public-facing wording checked against SANITIZATION.md. No private source excerpts.
2026-10-13: Added alongside native Terminal behavior and targeted UI verification.
